WEBVTT

00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:40.180
To become a beast-lord beastinarian at Kazalm,

00:01:40.690 --> 00:01:49.590
Erin has come with Jone to the Kazalm Beast-Lord Care Center to take the Trial of the Entrees.

00:01:52.310 --> 00:01:58.220
Teacher, Esal

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:05.490
Relax a little.

00:02:05.490 --> 00:02:07.490
There's no way you'll fail.

00:02:07.490 --> 00:02:09.150
But...

00:02:19.610 --> 00:02:21.080
A mute whistle...

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:29.170
You must be Erin.

00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:33.180
Y-Yes, I'm Erin.  Nice to meet you.

00:02:34.510 --> 00:02:38.770
I was told you're fourteen, but you look more like sixteen.

00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:42.150
She's grown a lot in the past two years.

00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:46.860
And you've tanned quite a bit.  You've changed, Jone.

00:02:47.970 --> 00:02:50.140
It's been a while, Esal.

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:52.110
You don't seem to have changed at all.

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:55.990
Let me give you a tour.

00:02:56.730 --> 00:02:57.850
Thanks.

00:02:57.850 --> 00:02:58.960
Come on.

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:01.440
All right, let's go.

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:02.330
Yeah.

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:04.890
You guys come this way.

00:03:04.890 --> 00:03:07.170
Wh---at?

00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:32.190
Now, this herb,

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:33.740
can someone tell me what it is?

00:03:34.530 --> 00:03:35.490
It's atsune weed.

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:38.950
That's right.  It's atsune weed.

00:03:38.950 --> 00:03:40.210
Hey look!

00:03:40.210 --> 00:03:41.960
Isn't she...

00:03:41.960 --> 00:03:43.880
What?  You mean?

00:03:54.760 --> 00:03:56.640
There's some beast-lords.

00:03:56.640 --> 00:03:57.460
This way.

00:03:57.460 --> 00:03:58.300
O-Okay!

00:04:07.190 --> 00:04:11.370
Tomura-senpai, is she the girl who was admitted specially?

00:04:11.370 --> 00:04:14.450
Yeah.  It's a girl who's from the Mist People.

00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:17.360
Hold on a moment.

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:20.980
Who's the Reverend of the Teachers right now?

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:25.120
You'll see when you enter.

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:37.550
H-Hey, you shouldn't enter without permission.

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:40.100
Welcome to Kazalm.

00:04:40.100 --> 00:04:41.930
My name is Esal, Reverend of the Teachers.

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:51.440
I've been the Reverend of the Teachers for two years now.

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:54.340
My, my...

00:04:54.340 --> 00:04:59.320
I thought you didn't have any interest in honor or promotions.

00:05:00.920 --> 00:05:03.390
This isn't Tamuyuan.

00:05:04.050 --> 00:05:08.630
At Kazalm, the Reverend of the Teachers is locked in for life.

00:05:08.630 --> 00:05:11.550
A person of ambition wouldn't rest well here.

00:05:16.240 --> 00:05:17.010
Erin.

00:05:17.010 --> 00:05:17.970
Yes!

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:20.940
Take a seat there.

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:24.320
I'll prepare some delicious tea for you.

00:05:24.320 --> 00:05:25.930
You don't even have a maid?

00:05:25.930 --> 00:05:32.480
No.  We have ten teachers and one dorm parent.

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:36.730
If we had the money to hire more people than necessary,

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:39.910
we'd spend it instead to prepare more students.

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:47.370
There you go.

00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:48.710
Thank you very much.

00:05:48.710 --> 00:05:53.380
Regardless of passing or failing, spend the night here.

00:05:53.380 --> 00:05:55.630
You must be tired from the traveling,

00:05:55.630 --> 00:05:58.170
so you can take the Trial tomorrow if you wish.

00:05:58.170 --> 00:05:58.840
What do you say?

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:07.680
If I can take it now, then I'd prefer to do it now.

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:09.460
Then let's do that.

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:13.270
But enjoy your tea first.

00:06:13.270 --> 00:06:14.610
It will relax you.

00:06:19.180 --> 00:06:20.900
It smells nice.

00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:24.580
It's delicious!

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:27.910
It's tea brewed from kalim leaves.

00:06:27.910 --> 00:06:31.710
"Kalim leaves?"  You dry out those thick reeds?

00:06:33.150 --> 00:06:35.030
Now you have a nicer face.

00:06:35.030 --> 00:06:37.170
Should we start now?

00:06:42.050 --> 00:06:44.140
You may begin.

00:06:44.140 --> 00:06:45.610
The time limit is one tou.

00:06:45.610 --> 00:06:46.460
Got it.

00:07:05.240 --> 00:07:08.730
Your letter surprised me.

00:07:08.730 --> 00:07:11.410
You wrote, "I want my daughter to enroll there."

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:12.410
Sorry I imposed on you.

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:14.000
Not that.

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:17.800
I never heard that you had a daughter.

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:21.550
Well, a lot has happened.

00:07:21.550 --> 00:07:24.760
I thought you would never come down from the mountain.

00:07:25.410 --> 00:07:27.330
That was my intention.

00:07:28.860 --> 00:07:29.680
But-

00:07:38.070 --> 00:07:40.320
It's been only half a tou.

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:42.320
Huh, really?

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:44.280
You're done?

00:07:44.280 --> 00:07:45.470
Yes.

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:37.620
I see.

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:39.540
No wonder she's your favorite.

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:41.000
How did she do?

00:08:46.010 --> 00:08:47.210
I'd say...

00:08:54.640 --> 00:08:58.250
Reverend of the Teachers, Karisa arrives to your summons.

00:08:59.110 --> 00:09:01.570
She's the dorm parent of the Kazalm dormitory.

00:09:01.570 --> 00:09:06.520
She acts as the mother of the sixty students here.

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:10.520
Karisa, take Erin to the dormitory.

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:13.050
We'll admit her into the 2nd year of Junior High.

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:17.970
Wow!  Skipping two years?

00:09:17.970 --> 00:09:20.370
She must be smart.

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:26.530
You'll enter the 2nd year of Junior High, in your age group.

00:09:26.530 --> 00:09:30.240
However, you'll be with the twelve-year-olds during practical classes,

00:09:30.240 --> 00:09:33.360
which starts from picking up dung from livestock and the beast-lords.

00:09:33.360 --> 00:09:34.350
Is that clear?

00:09:35.160 --> 00:09:37.820
Y... es...

00:09:37.820 --> 00:09:39.060
Thank you very much!

00:09:39.650 --> 00:09:43.570
I'll introduce you to your fellow pupils during dinner.

00:09:45.950 --> 00:09:48.150
Yes!  Thank you very much!

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:52.680
Rather than pupils, they're more like spoiled brats.

00:09:52.680 --> 00:09:53.820
I'm Karisa.

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:55.570
I hope to get to know you well.

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:57.370
I'm Erin.

00:09:57.370 --> 00:09:59.580
I'll be in your care.

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:02.680
Oh my, my!  What a very proper introduction.

00:10:02.680 --> 00:10:05.550
Girls are great.  They know how to act.

00:10:07.510 --> 00:10:09.630
Say, Reverend...

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:14.500
Let's admit more girls rather than those spoiled boys.

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:17.340
I'll think about it.

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:20.020
Prepare a guest room for him.

00:10:20.020 --> 00:10:20.850
Sorry about that.

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:21.980
Don't let it bother you.

00:10:21.980 --> 00:10:26.980
Oh right.  What are you going to do with your two clumsy followers?

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:29.790
"Clumsy?"

00:10:31.240 --> 00:10:33.160
Those two, eh?

00:10:33.160 --> 00:10:34.990
They'll probably go back with me.

00:10:36.370 --> 00:10:40.960
A barn is enough for them.

00:10:40.960 --> 00:10:43.010
That's an easy task.

00:10:43.010 --> 00:10:44.650
Shall we go?

00:10:44.650 --> 00:10:45.460
Yes.

00:10:50.190 --> 00:10:51.010
Oji-san.

00:10:51.800 --> 00:10:52.710
What?

00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:56.310
You'll still come around, right?

00:10:56.310 --> 00:10:58.520
Yeah.  I'll see you later.

00:11:23.980 --> 00:11:25.590
Hey.  How did it go?

00:11:25.590 --> 00:11:27.340
Did you pass?

00:11:27.340 --> 00:11:29.670
Yes.  It's thanks to you all.

00:11:29.670 --> 00:11:32.070
Which means we have to say goodbye here?

00:11:32.070 --> 00:11:33.750
I don't want that!

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:35.670
Oh?  So she passed.

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:37.980
A transfer student at this time of the year...

00:11:37.980 --> 00:11:40.690
She wouldn't have passed if she wasn't smart.

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:43.940
I'm really grateful.

00:11:45.400 --> 00:11:46.250
Take a look.

00:11:55.380 --> 00:11:56.450
This is?

00:11:56.450 --> 00:12:02.870
I've been a teacher for 30 years, so I've seen many bright students.

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:15.550
It means I'm not going to be surprised over results where, except for one small calculation error, every other problem is correct.

00:12:15.550 --> 00:12:21.050
But that essay she wrote honestly surprised me.

00:12:21.910 --> 00:12:25.230
"Why do you want to be a beastinarian?"

00:12:25.230 --> 00:12:31.070
I want to know why the living things in this world are the way they are.

00:12:32.230 --> 00:12:41.160
Animal or not, I can't help but wonder why they are the way they are.

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:44.870
I have been breeding bees.

00:12:44.870 --> 00:12:48.990
A bee is a very small creature.

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:53.910
But those small bees form a large swarm to live,

00:12:53.910 --> 00:13:00.550
and act in the most efficient way to make offspring.

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:03.390
One of those methods is the colony fission.

00:13:04.020 --> 00:13:06.290
I used the bees as an example,

00:13:06.290 --> 00:13:10.090
but I also want to know why beast-lords and humans exist.

00:13:10.090 --> 00:13:15.990
And I want to know why creatures exist, including myself.

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:25.120
I believe that learning about animals will definitely lead to what I want to know.

00:13:25.790 --> 00:13:29.580
That is why I want to become a beastinarian.

00:13:33.210 --> 00:13:36.060
You must be a teacher from your very heart.

00:13:36.060 --> 00:13:41.550
You raised a bright student even outside of a school.

00:13:43.270 --> 00:13:44.720
It's not like that.

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:47.060
I didn't bring her out.

00:13:47.520 --> 00:13:52.930
I think I have an understanding of the events through your mailing.

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:59.090
Since she passed the Trial of Entrees, she is now one of my students.

00:14:00.030 --> 00:14:02.150
There's more than what I wrote.

00:14:02.150 --> 00:14:05.830
Erin is actually from a village of Touda breeders.

00:14:05.830 --> 00:14:07.160
"Touda breeders?"

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:08.350
Yes.

00:14:08.350 --> 00:14:17.420
Erin's mother was executed by means of being fed to Touda, for letting a Touda die.

00:14:17.840 --> 00:14:22.080
I see.  She's got such a history, eh?

00:14:22.080 --> 00:14:28.390
That must be the reason behind her calmness, that's so unlike other fourteen-year-olds.

00:14:29.320 --> 00:14:33.150
Her mother being an Aowrow who broke their code.

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:38.150
Looking at her eyes gives away that she's of the Mist People.

00:14:40.070 --> 00:14:42.020
Don't worry.

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:48.480
Just in case Erin was admitted, I've already told everyone here,

00:14:48.480 --> 00:14:54.340
including the students, to ignore the fact that her mother is of the Mist People.

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:56.330
Thank you.

00:14:56.330 --> 00:15:02.390
It matters not: Arryo, Wajyaku, or Holon.  Of low social status or being a woman.

00:15:02.390 --> 00:15:07.710
If there's a heart which wishes to save a beast and has the mind to do it,

00:15:08.270 --> 00:15:12.160
then it takes nothing to be a student of this school.

00:15:14.820 --> 00:15:17.140
You really haven't changed.

00:15:18.210 --> 00:15:19.120
You're right.

00:15:28.670 --> 00:15:30.790
This is your room.

00:15:30.790 --> 00:15:34.200
There's another girl, so get along with her.

00:15:35.070 --> 00:15:36.130
I will.

00:15:36.130 --> 00:15:40.380
I had your two men carry your things in.

00:15:40.380 --> 00:15:44.800
Also, all the other students are boys,

00:15:44.800 --> 00:15:48.010
so they're sleeping in the big room over in that dorm.

00:15:48.010 --> 00:15:50.800
You and Yuuyan are special.

00:15:50.800 --> 00:15:51.720
"Yuuyan?"

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:54.140
Yeah, that's the other girl.

00:15:54.780 --> 00:15:59.480
It'll be supper time soon, so come to the cafeteria.

00:16:20.350 --> 00:16:21.880
Y-You're Erin?

00:16:24.410 --> 00:16:26.900
It's true!  You've got green eyes!

00:16:26.900 --> 00:16:28.970
You're really of the Mist People?

00:16:28.970 --> 00:16:31.800
Y-Yes.  I'm half.

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:33.790
Such pretty eyes!

00:16:33.790 --> 00:16:37.190
Ah, right.  Here, want some snacks as a warming gift?

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:40.550
Don't hesitate.

00:16:40.550 --> 00:16:43.690
I won't ask for money later.

00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:45.340
Ah, thank you!

00:16:45.340 --> 00:16:47.480
"Erin" means "wild apple," right?

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:49.240
They're so good, aren't they?

00:16:49.240 --> 00:16:53.390
I love roasting and then eating them while the honey is still dripping.

00:16:53.390 --> 00:16:55.370
So soft and so warm.

00:16:55.370 --> 00:16:56.970
Don't you agree?

00:16:56.970 --> 00:16:57.920
Y-Yes.

00:16:59.880 --> 00:17:02.500
Are you thinking I'm a weirdo?

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:04.030
Ah...

00:17:05.850 --> 00:17:07.510
I've done it again!

00:17:07.510 --> 00:17:09.330
See, I'm like this.

00:17:09.330 --> 00:17:13.890
Even Esal-sensei told me to keep it toned down.

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:17.330
Oh, I'm not bothered by it at all.

00:17:17.330 --> 00:17:18.420
Really?!

00:17:19.160 --> 00:17:19.940
Yes.

00:17:19.940 --> 00:17:21.260
You're such a good girl!

00:17:21.260 --> 00:17:22.900
I'm Yuuyan.

00:17:22.900 --> 00:17:24.820
Karisa-san had told me about you.

00:17:24.820 --> 00:17:26.780
I look forward to getting along with you.

00:17:26.780 --> 00:17:28.760
Oh, thanks for the politeness.

00:17:28.760 --> 00:17:31.100
The pleasure is mine.

00:17:32.510 --> 00:17:33.790
It's time for dinner.

00:17:33.790 --> 00:17:34.240
Let's go.

00:17:35.260 --> 00:17:36.180
Okay.

00:17:40.630 --> 00:17:42.090
I'm so hungry.

00:17:42.090 --> 00:17:43.960
Hey, be quiet.

00:17:43.960 --> 00:17:46.170
Be qu-i-et!

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:48.630
Everyone's looking at you.

00:17:48.630 --> 00:17:50.640
Because I'm of the Mist People?

00:17:50.640 --> 00:17:52.960
No.  It's 'cause you're cute.

00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:57.590
But the ones doing the looking are all potato-heads.

00:17:57.590 --> 00:17:58.730
Hey, look.

00:17:58.730 --> 00:18:00.520
They're just like this potato.

00:18:05.910 --> 00:18:07.270
She's laughing.

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:09.890
The girl next to her is Yuuyan.

00:18:09.890 --> 00:18:12.770
She's a good girl who doesn't let anyone hold her back,

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:13.950
so I'm sure they'll get along.

00:18:15.410 --> 00:18:19.460
Yeah.  Now I can be at ease.

00:18:45.770 --> 00:18:47.570
Oji-san!

00:18:47.570 --> 00:18:50.030
Hurry and load up.

00:18:50.030 --> 00:18:53.440
I can't do this labor so early in the morning.

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:55.240
It's because we didn't eat breakfast.

00:18:55.240 --> 00:18:57.200
Stop talking!
Sorry for all of these.

00:18:57.200 --> 00:18:58.120
Sorry for all of these.

00:18:58.120 --> 00:18:59.490
It's fine.

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:02.080
You should have spent more time.

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:04.460
I've got a bunch of stuff to do.

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:06.520
Is it all right?

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:08.420
Erin will be just fine.

00:19:08.420 --> 00:19:10.170
Not her.

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:11.380
I'm talking about you.

00:19:19.670 --> 00:19:22.050
I'm used to being alone.

00:19:22.050 --> 00:19:23.350
Oji-san!

00:19:25.360 --> 00:19:26.510
Oji-san...

00:19:28.900 --> 00:19:31.990
Thank you so much for your care.

00:19:35.050 --> 00:19:36.630
That's my line.

00:19:36.630 --> 00:19:38.200
Thank you.

00:19:47.600 --> 00:19:50.220
I've been holding it in ever since I came here.

00:19:50.220 --> 00:19:51.670
It's the last one you'll get to hear.

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:54.050
Gosh, Oji-san.

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:57.180
Take good care of them.

00:19:57.940 --> 00:20:01.240
They begged to stay, even if they were to work without pay.

00:20:01.240 --> 00:20:03.930
They're going to stay and help the dorm parent.

00:20:03.930 --> 00:20:06.240
We're not gonna leave you!

00:20:06.240 --> 00:20:07.730
We'll always be together!

00:20:17.560 --> 00:20:19.200
Stay well.

00:20:22.220 --> 00:20:24.280
If any trouble comes up...

00:20:24.280 --> 00:20:28.340
Well, knowing you, there probably won't be any,

00:20:28.340 --> 00:20:32.170
but if it does, think of Esal as your parent from now on and give her lots of trouble.

00:20:36.700 --> 00:20:38.140
See you.

00:20:43.850 --> 00:20:45.140
Take care!

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:49.550
Oji-san...

00:20:55.500 --> 00:20:56.520
I will.

00:21:17.010 --> 00:21:18.010
Erin...

00:21:20.100 --> 00:21:22.840
You are my proud daughter.

00:22:10.690 --> 00:22:13.370
As she watched the carriage move into the distance,

00:22:13.370 --> 00:22:18.280
Erin was remembering her happy life with Jone.

00:22:19.100 --> 00:22:23.320
And so here, at the Kazalm Beast-Lord Care Center,

00:22:23.320 --> 00:22:26.830
Erin's new life began.

00:24:02.140 --> 00:24:05.920
This female transfer student who became my roommate is the second girl at Kazalm,

00:24:05.920 --> 00:24:12.230
and is a funny girl who likes beast-lords more than the three meals each day.

00:24:12.230 --> 00:24:17.700
But she can't seem to blend in well with everyone, and she itches to watch from the side.

00:24:17.700 --> 00:24:21.030
It's my turn to intervene at times like these.

00:24:21.620 --> 00:24:23.410
Kemono no Souja Erin.

00:24:23.410 --> 00:24:25.040
Friends at Kazalm.

00:24:25.050 --> 00:24:30.030
Friends at Kazalm
